{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064103001:1":{"text":"お腹すいた……夕食の残りのパンがあってよかった。","source_cn":"好饿……幸好晚餐时剩下了一些面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBE7DF316D3178F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064103002:1":{"text":"なんて澄んだ月明かり……あの惨事さえなければ、素敵な夜になったのに……","source_cn":"月色多么皎洁啊……如果没有发生那桩惨案，本该是宁静的一夜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF85CE4493D61EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064103003:1":{"text":"ガシャッ……ガチャンッ……","source_cn":"咔吱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38B6C7D979833F3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064103004:1":{"text":"えっ……今の音は何？","source_cn":"……奇怪，哪里来的声音？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089B07C3B7B5F758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::0":{"text":"戸棚","source_cn":"橱柜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEF9F894DC6E389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064103005:1":{"text":"戸棚の方から聞こえたみたいだけど……ネズミが盗み食いでもしてるのかな。","source_cn":"好像是从那只橱柜里传出来的。难道有老鼠在偷吃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD71875B6B28DB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064103006:1":{"text":"そうはさせない！早く追い払わないと……","source_cn":"这可不行！我得把它们赶走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x239749EDFA9CBCF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1064103007:1":{"text":"エイダはそっと戸棚に近づき、勢いよく扉を開け放った。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EE3A725434FECB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1064103008:1":{"text":"しかし、中に潜んでいたのはネズミではなく……刃物を握った男だった！","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F846ADBAEDAEB61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064103009:1":{"text":"あ……あなたは誰！？","source_cn":"你……你是谁？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA315D60602DDC975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064103010:0":{"text":"くそ……","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064103011:0":{"text":"――死ねぇっ！！","source_cn":"——去死吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD802988910ED97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064103012:0":{"text":"きゃー！！た、助けてぇー！！","source_cn":"啊——！救、救命啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCA90DF0831B0E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064103013:0":{"text":"逃がすか！今日がお前の……","source_cn":"别想跑！今天就是你的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC41111445F3903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1064103014:0":{"text":"天から一筋の光が降り注ぎ、悪党の言葉を断ち切った。","source_cn":"一道神光从天而降，终结了恶徒的话语","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0314DCE59A647138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:1064103015:1":{"text":"エイダが震えながら目を開けると、彼女ははっきりとその光景を目にした――","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95F8C7D0D5D4EAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1064103016:1":{"text":"悪党の胸を白金色のランスが貫き、彼はすでに息絶えていた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA29AD611B563D01A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1064103017:1":{"text":"やがてそのランスは、神聖な気配を放つ人の姿へと変わっていった。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF52D53E436FBB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064103018:1":{"text":"裁決は下された。","source_cn":"裁决已至。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A888042F5B8C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064103019:1":{"text":"あ、あなた様は……","source_cn":"您、您是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5831AC0C12DCAFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064103020:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064103021:1":{"text":"何があったの！？ああ……まさか……","source_cn":"发生了什——噢，天哪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF884EB5C08AAE4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064103022:1":{"text":"そ……そこにおられるのはアタリア様！","source_cn":"艾雅在上……是、是阿塔利娅大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76BE8CCF77925DBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064103023:1":{"text":"ほ、本当にアタリア様……伝説に語られるジャスティスブレードなのですか……","source_cn":"真、真的是阿塔利娅大人，传说中的天罚之刃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x759B4472F1CAC833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064103024:1":{"text":"悪は裁かれた。","source_cn":"恶徒已经清除。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F5CB7462479D7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064103025:1":{"text":"悪……とは、この男のことでしょうか？","source_cn":"您是说这个男人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5EDE4BBDBF5C58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064103026:1":{"text":"そうです！この男は戸棚に潜んでいて、わたしが見つけた途端に襲いかかってきたんです！","source_cn":"是的！路易莎修女，他一直躲在橱柜里，被我发现后还想伤害我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A634AA10931E7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064103027:1":{"text":"待って……まさかヴィンセンツォさん！？","source_cn":"艾雅在上……这不是文森佐吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81361E56AB70A3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064103028:1":{"text":"ヴィンセンツォさん？彼と知り合いなんですか？","source_cn":"文森佐？您认识他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5686B0E10B7E8331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064103029:1":{"text":"この前、教会が難民を受け入れていたときの話をしたわよね。彼も当時、この戸棚に身を潜めていた一人よ……","source_cn":"十年前，教堂曾收留过很多战争难民，文森佐就是其中之一。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AA5A6C23FA397F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064103030:1":{"text":"彼は難民などではない。ブラックゴールド商会の残党で、あちこちで悪事を働いていた。","source_cn":"他不是战争难民，他是黑金商会的残党，四处为非作歹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E94BD7987B309E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064103031:0":{"text":"そうなのですね……まさかブラックゴールド商会に加わってたなんて……","source_cn":"没想到，他竟然加入了黑金商会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5BE45A0CEC965A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064103032:0":{"text":"アタリア様、突然の質問をお許しください。彼は……そこまで多くの悪事を働いたのでしょうか？","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人，请宽恕我的冒昧询问。他做了很多坏事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC81DF42CE4C76D20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064103033:0":{"text":"そう。ブラックゴールド商会の者どもは皆同じだ。","source_cn":"是。黑金商会成员皆是如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAC80B225D85D61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064103034:1":{"text":"他の仲間もすでに裁いた。","source_cn":"其余同党都已被我裁决。而他，竟敢躲藏于教堂，玷污女神庇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF95CAA5B015BBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064103035:1":{"text":"では、リロさんを殺した犯人も、彼という可能性はあるのでしょうか？","source_cn":"那么，杀害列罗的凶手，有没有可能也是他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD22900452DA7977F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064103036:1":{"text":"殺人だと？","source_cn":"杀害他人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1777775CCF874BD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064103037:1":{"text":"はい、エンサ村で起こった悲惨な事件です……","source_cn":"是，恩莎村发生了一桩惨案……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF99C69E07308A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:56:1064103038:1":{"text":"二人はリロの死について詳しく語った。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392BCA8FEFE3C7F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064103039:1":{"text":"……以上が事の次第です。","source_cn":"……事情就是如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64F44C2DBA93A9CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064103040:1":{"text":"アタリア様、彼がリロさんを殺害した犯人なのか、神の力でお確かめいただけないでしょうか？その哀れな母子に、どうか慈悲をお与えください……","source_cn":"尊敬的阿塔利娅大人，能否恳请您用神力确认文森佐是否为杀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E91CA67C15176A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064103041:1":{"text":"凶器と傷口、それに血液の照合が必要だ。","source_cn":"需要比对凶器、伤口和血液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14B6E3CC9A628D37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064103042:1":{"text":"遺体はどこにある？","source_cn":"尸体在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6A18F2783DB5B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064103043:1":{"text":"こちらです。","source_cn":"请随我来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6596F9C2B88DFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","var